WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.055 --> 00:00:03.711
PJ was still breaking rocks.

2
00:00:03.712 --> 00:00:06.216
Brekk-a-brekk-a!

3
00:00:06.217 --> 00:00:10.331
"Stop!" Ringo shouted.

4
00:00:10.332 --> 00:00:14.189
PJ stopped. "What's wrong?"

5
00:00:14.190 --> 00:00:17.581
"We can't break the rocks," Ringo said.

6
00:00:17.582 --> 00:00:20.310
"The tunnel will cave in."

7
00:00:20.311 --> 00:00:29.141
"Let's move the rocks," Bot said.

8
00:00:29.142 --> 00:00:33.634
The robots lifted a rock.

9
00:00:33.635 --> 00:00:38.064
"Ringo, you're in the way," Bot said.

10
00:00:38.065 --> 00:00:40.487
Ringo stepped back.

11
00:00:40.488 --> 00:00:43.271
"Ouch!" Lucy said.

12
00:00:43.272 --> 00:00:46.121
"You stepped on my foot!"

13
00:00:46.122 --> 00:00:55.559
"Sorry!" Ringo said.

14
00:00:55.560 --> 00:01:03.497
Bot and PJ put the rock down.

15
00:01:03.498 --> 00:01:11.343
Bot and PJ lifted another rock.

16
00:01:11.344 --> 00:01:13.721
PJ looked around.

17
00:01:13.722 --> 00:01:18.714
"There's nowhere to put this rock," he said.

18
00:01:18.715 --> 00:01:21.632
"The tunnel is too narrow."

19
00:01:21.633 --> 00:01:24.477
A space bat swooped by.

20
00:01:24.478 --> 00:01:28.589
"Ahh!" Ringo and Lucy screamed.

21
00:01:28.590 --> 00:01:32.146
"Are you okay?" a miner shouted.

22
00:01:32.147 --> 00:01:38.693
Ringo felt silly. "Yes, we're fine."

23
00:01:38.694 --> 00:01:41.222
More bats flew by.

24
00:01:41.223 --> 00:01:44.450
They flew up and seemed to disappear.

25
00:01:44.451 --> 00:01:50.371
Everyone looked up.

26
00:01:50.372 --> 00:01:54.413
"There's a hole up there," Lucy said.

27
00:01:54.414 --> 00:02:00.321
Ding! "I have a plan," Bot said.

28
00:02:00.322 --> 00:02:04.868
"But you will not like it."

29
00:02:04.869 --> 00:02:09.076
"What is it?" Ringo asked.

30
00:02:09.077 --> 00:02:12.737
Bot pointed at the space bats.

31
00:02:12.738 --> 00:02:18.939
"We must follow those space bats!"

